    "about": "Schema of windows/version.json as written by windows/build_package.sh. The real file has no comment field; everything else here is an example.",
    "package_version": "The x.y.z version of this package, matching the CacheCoin-Windows-<version>.zip file name. The build script accepts a leading v and strips it.",
    "built_utc": "UTC time the package was assembled, format YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ. Informational only; it is not part of any checksum input except through this file's own hash.",
